  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/59610fd9ad1f6d2cbe858b383a463c72a0bd2f6e93536f44fc2d5324b4e756bf.png] \n\nInterchanging the numbers and using the BODMAS rule,\n\nOption 1 → 8 and 7\n\nGiven equation: 9 + 7 - (6 ÷ 3 - 4) × 8 = 31\n\n**__9 + 8__** - (__**6 ÷ 3 **__- 4) × 7 = 31\n\n17 - __**(2 - 4) **__× 7 = 31\n\n17 **- (-2) **× 7 = 31\n\n17 + 2 × 7 = 31\n\n17 + 14 = 31\n\n**31 = 31**\n\nOption 2 → 9 and 7\n\nGiven equation: 9 + 7 - (6 ÷ 3 - 4) × 8 = 31\n\n__**7 + 9**__ - (__**6 ÷ 3**__ - 4) × 8 = 31\n\n18 - __**(2 - 4) **__× 8 = 31\n\n18 __**- (-2) **__× 8 = 31\n\n18 +__** 2 × 8**__ = 31\n\n18 + 16 =31\n\n**34 ≠ 31 **\n\nOption 3 → 6 and 7\n\nGiven equation: 9 + 7 - (6 ÷ 3 - 4) × 8 = 31\n\n__**9 + 6 **__- (__**7 ÷ 3**__ - 4) × 8 = 31\n\n15 - (1.33 - 4) × 8 = 31\n\n**15 - (- 2.67) × 8 ≠ 31**\n\nOption 4 → 4 and 7\n\nGiven equation: 9 + 7 - (6 ÷ 3 - 4) × 8 = 31\n\n__**9 + 4 **__- (__**6 ÷ 3**__ - 7) × 8 = 31\n\n13 - (__**2 - 7**__) × 8 = 31\n\n13 __**- (-5)**__ × 8 = 31\n\n13 + 5 × 8 = 31\n\n13 + 40 = 31\n\n**53 ≠ 31**\n\nHence, the correct answer is** \"8 and 7\".**",
